OASIS AMQP 1.0 core specification artifacts, vendored verbatim
=============================================================

The XML files in this directory are unmodified copies of the OASIS Standard
artifacts for AMQP 1.0 core, published 29 October 2012. Their byte identity is
pinned by SHA-256 in `toolchain/sources.toml` and checked by
`scripts/fetch-oasis.sh --verify`.

They MUST NOT be edited. Every clause identifier, disposition, generated table
and vector citation in this repository refers to these bytes; a local edit would
silently invalidate the evidence that depends on them.

