Scope note
----------

These artifacts are AMQP 1.0 core (Parts 0-5). The OASIS TC's repository
`oasis-tcs/amqp-specs` additionally publishes working drafts for protocol
extensions — addressing, management (`amqp-man`), claims-based security
(`amqp-cbs`), filter expressions (`filtex`), HTTP-over-AMQP, event streams and
connection-info. Those are outside this specification's scope; they are not part
of the OASIS Standard for core AMQP 1.0 and are not vendored here.
